Z||000014||Jimmy||12-13-2001||12:57 AM||||I ran 13.6s, pretty slow cause my clutch wouldn't hold in fourth.  60' times were 1.8 sec.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">  Unfortunately I made it to the track when my car was running its worst. I am fixing this problem over the winter and will add some HP too.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Can't wait till spring!<P>Jim ||||reg||1
Z||000015||loafer87gt||12-13-2001||01:20 AM||||What was up with the Z28 and the Bug? Were they both modded pretty heavily? They both seemed to be pretty quick cars.||||reg||1
Z||000016||Jimmy||12-13-2001||01:25 AM||||Its hard to say, a lot of people lie obviously.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif">  The Z28 has an awesome motor but terrible tranny and gearing(2.71?).  He puts on a good burnout show at the end of every night, he leaves baseball size chunks of rubber behind his car!  I was just screwin with the bug, I really lit it up at the start and spun them for a bit. <p>[This message has been edited by Jimmy (edited 12-13-2001).]||||reg||1
