Z||000020||MinnGreenGT||12-13-2001||12:17 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by GTMike:<BR><B>how do u use the ftp thing   copied and pasted it on my browser  but nothing happen when i clicked go.  how do i get it?????</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>If your browser doesn't support ftp (which it doesn't sound like it does), then you'll need to download an FTP program from somplace like <A HREF="http://www.tucows.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.tucows.com</A>  then put in the address and use "anonymous" as the username and your email address as your password.<BR>----------------------------------------<P>Jimmy- sweet videos!  I couldn't download the entire thing on the last one (15+MB monte's & lightning)... I at least saw the 2 monte's  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Jason- thanks a ton for compressing and loading the videos!  Can't wait to see your montage finished (you may want to consider posting it also a ZIP file to speed up transfers... that is- if MPGs compress in ZIP...?)||||reg||1
